  "question": "For $A=\\begin{bmatrix}3&2\\\\1&1\\end{bmatrix}$, find $A^{-1}$. Hence, determine $X$ if $AX=\\begin{bmatrix}8\\\\3\\end{bmatrix}$ and verify the result.",
