  "explanation": "<b>Calculation of the inverse</b><br>Since $$|A|=(3)(1)-(2)(1)=1,$$ $$A^{-1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1&-2\\\\-1&3\\end{bmatrix}$$<br><b>Determination of $X$</b><br>Using $X=A^{-1}B$, $$X=\\begin{bmatrix}1&-2\\\\-1&3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}8\\\\3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2\\\\1\\end{bmatrix}$$<br><b>Verification</b><br>$$AX=\\begin{bmatrix}3&2\\\\1&1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2\\\\1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}8\\\\3\\end{bmatrix}$$ Hence, $X=\\begin{bmatrix}2\\\\1\\end{bmatrix}$.",
